  <item>
    <title>几分钟看电影，让人上瘾到忘记原片？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/61ef9dea4675a08411f515d2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">61ef9dea4675a08411f515d2</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 25 Jan 2022 14:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>围绕“几分钟看电影”系列短视频的版权争议并没有持续受到关注，道理懂都懂，可宣判迟迟未见标准定论，是否反映其背后更多是利益分配不当的问题，毕竟片方拍出来也不是为了束之高阁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="145">02:25</a> 北美影视人极度不齿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="300">05:00</a> 北美法规如何鉴定是否侵权</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">08:15</a> 鉴定标准终究是难以量化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 油管的版权保护严苛制度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 利益分配问题才是实质冲突</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 北美片方如何“借力”短视频博主</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1135">18:55</a> 国内一定程度上的试验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a> 尊重原创精神是合作谈判前提</span></p><span></span><p><span>女神主播小书童，北美影视业从业十余年。男神经主播小宝，国内某大厂前影视内容商业化搬砖人。</span></p>]]></description>
